{"id": "1791490", "name": "גבול סדרה - התכנסות תת-סדרה לקבוע אוילר", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div title=\"BGU_STACK_V5\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1f2937;line-height:1.65;text-align:right;\">\n<div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:10px;\">גבול סדרה</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:3px;\">שימוש בגבול המגדיר את הקבוע \\(\\displaystyle e\\)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:16px;\"><div>חשבו את גבול הסדרה</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:19px;margin:10px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle a_n=\\left(1+\\frac{1}{{{CT:0}}^n+{{CT:1}}}\\right)^{{{CT:2}}\\cdot{{CT:0}}^n}\\)</div></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border:1px solid #EEECEF;border-radius:10px;padding:14px;margin-bottom:12px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<span>\\(\\displaystyle \\lim_{n\\to\\infty}a_n=\\)</span>\n<span>[[input:ans1]]<div style=\"margin-top:10px;padding-top:9px;border-top:1px solid #EEECEF;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;color:#665f6b;margin-bottom:4px;\">בדיקת ההקלדה</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:isolate;text-align:center;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></span>\n</div></div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div title=\"BGU_STACK_V5\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1f2937;line-height:1.65;text-align:right;\">\n<div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:10px;\">פתרון</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:3px;\">כתיבה בצורה של הגבול המופלא</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:16px;\"><p>נסמן \\(\\displaystyle m_n={{CT:0}}^n+{{CT:1}}\\). אז \\(\\displaystyle m_n\\to\\infty\\), וגם</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\frac{{{CT:2}}\\,{{CT:0}}^n}{m_n}\\longrightarrow {{CT:2}}\\)</p>\n<p>נכתוב</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\\(\\displaystyle a_n=[\\left(1+\\frac{1}{m_n}\\right)^{m_n}]^{\\frac{{{CT:2}}{{CT:0}}^n}{m_n}}\\)</p>\n<p>הביטוי שבסוגריים שואף ל-\\(\\displaystyle e\\), והמעריך שואף ל-\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:2}}\\). לכן</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\lim_{n\\to\\infty}a_n=e^{{CT:2}}\\)</p></div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\">[[feedback:Result]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "[[BASIC-CALCULUS]]", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "theLimit", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\">נכון. הגבול הוא \\(\\displaystyle e^{{CT:2}}\\).</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\">התשובה אינה נכונה. נסו לכתוב את הביטוי בעזרת \\(\\displaystyle \\left(1+rac1m\night\\right)^m\\).</p>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["aa", "bb", "cc", "theLimit"], "nvariants": 48}